if mibBuilder.loadTexts: frPortCnfPortGrpTable.setDescription('This table is used for creating/configuring \n        Frame Relay Logical(referred to as frame relay port)Ports. \n\n        Relation with ifTable: \n\n            The modules in which ifTable is implemented,\n            the creation of frame relay port in this table\n            will cause an entry to be created in ifTable.\n            The possible interfaces that are created in\n            ifTable are identified by ifType = frameRelayService(44)\n            and frForward(158).\n \n            The deletion of an entry in this table causes\n            the corresponding entry in ifTable to be deleted.\n        ')
